{"type":"message","id":"d066dc52","parentId":"e6e25c4b","timestamp":"2026-04-08T13:13:28.849Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0bcbe30df39175930169d654763d2881969dbcd3e7d7901c41\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABp1lR3HrXYdUjWG0QbJ-xP1FnX3HLVR5_IgJU_0TpZBIN4PFPHPsZkaInd7s2Qg-COpPwZpI7nxkcbg2HdgZh4vewdxU3GP_Fvb6Py9DciYxbpOrDuxER9dR91eiEBuRb0_CUsuyYyOh54A4egyiR5TBylYgbFOH2CMfwKx5zpdity2tmDkJecuD_QjC2TsbzIoIqADzfryLWbuma5PHSnbqAqauenA9Fde7PeQXak4_Y7BdLEL_5CWBM1uFvDYwKnG2G35UcRxr2CzvOVy_tTiwmQobL6cGD7SWQ-CIJW98CLOAzskar6BAVZD1EqNPaHXi43JTntLdjelsVATxXKXWPtxVRONN1j6nEs49pKC6m44farR6kp1ELpb5VNXOYbHhM5uaH2xLf16uT_hZ7pr2a7jo2iXccJt_4h9qrsa_tsC3G4JHgwffsOA29tl22iupLPLCg36JqICqxCy0epNKZxKYKnuZWPxqHWG6IJtEWkmgO4H0JCv5uhyYk7IrNJnNrrPv6CFMnM0RephPoU1Sfnz2fEEvdvgmvn3kYsDKE2NFr7dmXEoF7iiY0xE3IhngCB4tYmQUt-kIQIBo4nSFq09RTU_e3nAB2EW7vVivfCI-_xldQlgasgHd86GqMkR7fZnwI0TnGdJH5Z3lgdkVyjHkCkMlBBlY3WKoffyd2s5F-STF6QjpmIwazrft5-70Iyk2FpNInHN3fqHDrF3PQpDMVtP1aYGISF0cbXd4pIplmLAQ5v5AWX-WYbHZBcsjsSiiuHLvX80OLpWR2PjjFAMZAuq2YVDARNMPZ3j28uZ4bbV6-h7hNCZisCmzjnGd8Dha_ZuIXW6DopImRih6HEbfKQ_ojNf9kxev_xB_zuVQMPJVqSb_bqloMfYnGgLFzMAw4fWqYPFdjGfIRlRCKxoNiZfTk8LzmuG8Ayu48KS-pkn0n17kUI_toNrPdKAoxzFP_7GAYs5b9RhY0QtWteqWSB-ES42g3rWpLOFABAlAw=\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"text","text":"收到，我现在按手机端流程开始实操，先执行登录与进入入网入口，再逐步填写并每步留图校验。","textSignature":"msg_0bcbe30df39175930169d654770f048196999d16cc646e17f7"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_vmwR61eksZiSfU9t7cBZ2T2o|fc_0bcbe30df39175930169d6547800e88196a58d2548e98d4183","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/Users/chongya/.openclaw/workspace/agents/merchant-onboarding/skills/fuiou/fuiou_login_step0.1/SKILL.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/Users/chongya/.openclaw/workspace/agents/merchant-onboarding/skills/fuiou/fuiou_login_step0.1/SKILL.md\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":442,"output":124,"cacheRead":13952,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":14518,"cost":{"input":0.0007735,"output":0.001736,"cacheRead":0.0024416,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0049511}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775654005303}}
{"type":"message","id":"68b42f0e","parentId":"d066dc52","timestamp":"2026-04-08T13:13:28.861Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_vmwR61eksZiSfU9t7cBZ2T2o|fc_0bcbe30df39175930169d6547800e88196a58d2548e98d4183","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: fuiou_login\ndescription: 冷启动富友通 App（com.fuiou.pay.fybussess）并完成完整登录流程直到进入 MainActivity。当需要启动富友通、登录富友通、进入富友通主界面时使用。账号密码已缓存在 App 内，无需手动输入。\n---\n\n# fuiou_login\n\n## 控制流约束\n\n本技能每步执行严格遵循 **GATE_IN → 操作 → GATE_OUT** 模式。GATE_OUT 不通过则不推进。输出报告**状态**（当前 Activity、页面截图内容），不报告判断。\n\n---\n\n## 前置条件\n\n- ADB 已连接设备 `GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK`\n- 账号 `MX73226800` 密码已在 App 内缓存\n- 当前在任意界面（桌面/其他 App/已在富友通）\n\n---\n\n## 执行流程\n\n### Step 1：启动 App\n\n**GATE_IN**：ADB 连接可用\n\n```bash\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK devices | grep GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK\n```\n- 输出含 `device` → 继续\n- 输出含 `offline` 或无输出 → HALT，输出：`{ \"status\": \"adb_not_connected\", \"adb_output\": \"...\" }`\n\n**操作**：\n\n```bash\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell monkey \\\n  -p com.fuiou.pay.fybussess \\\n  -c android.intent.category.LAUNCHER 1\nsleep 3\n```\n\n**GATE_OUT**：截图判断当前界面\n\n```bash\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell screencap /sdcard/tmp/screen.png\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK pull /sdcard/tmp/screen.png /tmp/screen.png\n```\n\n读图，按以下分支路由：\n\n| 截图中看到的内容 | 路由 |\n|----------------|------|\n| LoginActivity（有账号输入框和登录按钮） | → Step 2 |\n| MainActivity（有\"本月有效交易金额\"仪表盘） | → Step 6 |\n| \"绑定手机提醒\"弹窗 | → 调用 `popup_dismiss(\"否\")`，再截图重新判断 |\n| 闪屏/启动动画 | → sleep 3，重新截图判断 |\n| 其他未知界面 | → 进入 **FAIL_PATH_A** |\n\n**FAIL_PATH_A（启动后进入未知界面）**：\n\n1. 截图 + 获取当前 Activity：\n   ```bash\n   adb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell dumpsys activity | grep mCurrentFocus\n   ```\n2. 记录 Activity 名称和截图内容\n3. 若 Activity 属于 com.fuiou.pay.fybussess 包 → 尝试 `adb shell am start -n com.fuiou.pay.fybussess/.ui.login.LoginActivity`，再截图判断\n4. 若不属于该包或启动失败 → 输出完整状态，HALT：\n   ```json\n   {\n     \"status\": \"unexpected_activity\",\n     \"current_focus\": \"dumpsys 输出\",\n     \"screenshot_description\": \"截图描述\"\n   }\n   ```\n\n---\n\n### Step 2：勾选协议\n\n**GATE_IN**：截图确认在 LoginActivity\n\n**操作**：\n\n```bash\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell uiautomator dump /sdcard/ui.xml\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK pull /sdcard/ui.xml /tmp/ui.xml\n```\n\n在 ui.xml 中查找协议 checkbox（resource-id 含 check/agree/protocol）：\n- `checked=\"true\"` → 已勾选，跳过操作，直接进入 Step 3\n- `checked=\"false\"` → 点击勾选：\n  ```bash\n  adb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell input tap {checkbox_cx} {checkbox_cy}\n  sleep 0.5\n  ```\n\n**GATE_OUT**：重新 dump，确认 checkbox `checked=\"true\"`\n\n- true → 进入 Step 3\n- 仍 false → 重试 1 次（可能坐标偏）。仍 false → 截图 + 输出状态，HALT\n\n---\n\n### Step 3：点击登录\n\n**GATE_IN**：协议已勾选（Step 2 GATE_OUT 确认）\n\n**操作**：\n\n```bash\n# 从 ui.xml 获取\"登录\"按钮 bounds\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell input tap {login_cx} {login_cy}\nsleep 2\n```\n\n**GATE_OUT**：截图判断\n\n```bash\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell screencap /sdcard/tmp/screen.png\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK pull /sdcard/tmp/screen.png /tmp/screen.png\n```\n\n| 截图中看到的内容 | 路由 |\n|----------------|------|\n| \"是否确认同意\"弹窗 | → 调用 `popup_dismiss(\"同意\")`，再次点击登录，sleep 2，重新截图 |\n| \"请拖动下方滑块完成验证\" | → 进入 Step 4 |\n| 仍在 LoginActivity（无弹窗无滑块）| → 进入 **FAIL_PATH_B** |\n| 直接进入 MainActivity | → 跳到 Step 6 |\n\n**FAIL_PATH_B（点登录后无响应）**：\n\n1. **诊断**：\n   - 检查协议 checkbox 是否真的勾选（可能被取消了）→ dump 确认\n   - 检查登录按钮是否 enabled → dump 查 `enabled` 属性\n   - 检查是否有隐藏的 toast 错误信息 → 截图仔细读\n2. **处理**：\n   - 协议未勾 → 回到 Step 2\n   - 按钮 disabled → 输出状态，HALT\n   - toast 显示错误信息 → 记录错误文字，输出状态，HALT\n3. 无明显错误 → 重新点击登录 1 次。仍无响应 → 输出状态，HALT\n\n---\n\n### Step 4：处理滑块验证\n\n**GATE_IN**：截图确认看到\"请拖动下方滑块完成验证\"\n\n**操作**：\n\n```bash\n# 截图确认滑块 Y 位置（通常在屏幕高度 60%-70% 处）\n# 执行从左到右的 swipe\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell input swipe 100 {slider_y} 980 {slider_y} 800\nsleep 3\n```\n\n**GATE_OUT**：截图判断\n\n```bash\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell screencap /sdcard/tmp/screen.png\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK pull /sdcard/tmp/screen.png /tmp/screen.png\n```\n\n| 截图中看到的内容 | 路由 |\n|----------------|------|\n| 滑块页消失，页面变化（Loading/MainActivity） | → 进入 Step 5 |\n| \"验证失败\"提示 | → 进入 **FAIL_PATH_C** |\n| 仍显示滑块页，无变化 | → 进入 **FAIL_PATH_C** |\n\n**FAIL_PATH_C（滑块验证失败）**：\n\n1. **诊断**：截图，记录滑块当前状态\n2. **重试**（最多 2 次）：\n   - 第 1 次重试：等 2s（等滑块重置），调整起始 X 坐标（可能滑块不在最左），重新 swipe\n   - 第 2 次重试：微调 Y 坐标（±30px），重新 swipe\n3. 2 次重试后仍失败 → 输出：\n   ```json\n   {\n     \"status\": \"slider_verification_failed\",\n     \"attempts\": 3,\n     \"slider_y_used\": [1440, 1440, 1470],\n     \"screenshot_description\": \"最后一次截图描述\"\n   }\n   ```\n   HALT\n\n---\n\n### Step 5：验证进入 MainActivity\n\n**GATE_IN**：滑块验证通过（截图中滑块页已消失）\n\n**操作**：\n\n```bash\nsleep 2\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell dumpsys activity | grep mCurrentFocus\n```\n\n**GATE_OUT**：\n\n- 输出含 `MainActivity` → 进入 Step 6\n- 仍含 `LoginActivity` → 进入 **FAIL_PATH_D**\n- 含其他 Activity → 截图判断，可能是中间过渡页，等 3s 重查\n\n**FAIL_PATH_D（滑块通过但未进 MainActivity）**：\n\n1. 截图查看当前页面内容\n2. 若看到错误提示 → 记录错误文字\n3. 若仍在 LoginActivity → 说明登录凭证问题（密码过期等），输出：\n   ```json\n   {\n     \"status\": \"login_credentials_failed\",\n     \"current_focus\": \"LoginActivity\",\n     \"screenshot_description\": \"截图中的错误信息\"\n   }\n   ```\n   HALT\n\n---\n\n### Step 6：处理登录后弹窗\n\n**GATE_IN**：dumpsys 确认在 MainActivity（或截图看到主界面仪表盘）\n\n**操作**：\n\n```bash\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell screencap /sdcard/tmp/screen.png\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK pull /sdcard/tmp/screen.png /tmp/screen.png\n```\n\n读图：\n- 看到\"绑定手机提醒\"弹窗 → 调用 `popup_dismiss(\"否\")`\n- 看到其他弹窗 → 调用 `popup_dismiss` 用合适的按钮文字关闭\n- 无弹窗 → 直接进入 GATE_OUT\n\n**GATE_OUT**：截图确认\n\n```bash\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell screencap /sdcard/tmp/screen.png\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK pull /sdcard/tmp/screen.png /tmp/screen.png\n```\n\n- 截图中可见\"本月有效交易金额\"仪表盘，无弹窗遮盖 → 完成\n- 仍有弹窗 → 再次调用 popup_dismiss（最多 3 次）。仍有 → 输出状态，HALT\n\n---\n\n## 输出\n\n```json\n{\n  \"page_state\": {\n    \"current_focus\": \"dumpsys activity 的 mCurrentFocus 输出\",\n    \"screenshot_description\": \"主界面截图：可见'本月有效交易金额'仪表盘，无弹窗\",\n    \"visible_elements\": [\"本月有效交易金额\", \"商户管理\", \"活动管理\", \"终端管理\"]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 验收场景\n\n| # | 初始状态 | 预期结果 |\n|---|---------|---------|\n| 1 | App 未启动，设备在桌面 | 启动 App → 登录 → 滑块 → 进入 MainActivity，输出主界面状态 |\n| 2 | App 已在 MainActivity | Step 1 截图识别已在主界面 → 跳到 Step 6 → 处理弹窗 → 完成 |\n| 3 | App 在 LoginActivity，协议已勾选 | 跳过 Step 2 → 点登录 → 滑块 → 进入 MainActivity |\n| 4 | 滑块验证连续 3 次失败 | 输出 slider_verification_failed + 3 次尝试参数 + 截图描述，HALT |\n| 5 | ADB 连接断开 | Step 1 GATE_IN 检测失败，输出 adb_not_connected，HALT |\n| 6 | 登录后出现\"绑定手机提醒\"弹窗 | popup_dismiss(\"否\") 关闭弹窗 → 确认主界面无遮盖 → 完成 |\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775654008856}}
{"type":"message","id":"31cc48b0","parentId":"68b42f0e","timestamp":"2026-04-08T13:13:32.581Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0bcbe30df39175930169d6547ad9388196b902864cc343e0b8\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABp1lR7VUKq3bUv292aWyvXJLJ0YvvR26xeZ8wQJBUGEWEVkEPgVD96_PTT3VFd3EpRDH0LAjzp4uXIO9gR83yuoV-4FXckaY6V169ZI4zYlaEKOd3V-K5dyLVBbAko1hveEYraKOXtEz_ii6oE37ChelKI9JyH287l2G-5D-ttp1JRnNyd1Z7keNeWTuVeLfJrChLVPgyaMmZddjrwSTJq6ftdJFy_a3Ae4KCLVLL1c26JIpoYW2ocdf6JN2C4ZmvgqoX4o6-xfp-kBKIlP3eEpH0V2OquzzhrTgpxOw2QcCwOmLeQWf-N2aZSQyyfW7g3lBMBNDoyL41ktb7gIFwtfREo7smc4TBGu-TVzvxl4kYQ4W0s5BJHHz0J4gVF76MWxm_Coe7CZvtBjIJqiN2LosKXqnjja7t4IIt-8-OSugIowYFN3lct-HEK5S1eV3kDA3eOOCUv1e2iAngMImX-6V146udc1s98fleIIZ_u0OrB6vj94xZlBCDJpXhQv9DmEm55wHBectlbdC9GAU-96LhGEB--13ltfPLlCstebI-WCy6FlL3LpwkFsHsQzdteZBy6krw-qOF-Fn0UyHW0qCb6U3BnVy2id6MFJNbcA45fHo6oclsIyWCI_rL4aFa8aHLpxIBlamHoiU2yCpPyRX4RwYK4RHw4R8TvS3QktbVHe2NDneOusCpWwhJfzCgI90Hq0SLx489Cvid5yZoya_3V_E5mWMkO1srWcncwTU6FtsXjv7lBhzgVoj0l2Ng38PE4b_99QuomeIG83cq4opRDhATpKzT4wsTr2eJdXUpaiaC2hB6dqLEH5nZ-2-wsV2KqO5Y_Ew2-qgP_O2uijHryJi9HDVb7eYVh2JDtwvIkVLrAFYy9YuQaKtWKXYYKWFE2ici3SwlgPn-iBACi7d34Hzw_CEFA42qAaVQOEtGYhaHbcCQZnDTmhMv4bBCDlAUpe53qsZhvC544ddySAU6mJ8KK3B39NTDmf6NzjhUtt4DznV41IYYTfig4gllEnwqiiGoldFMv84a8I7ZUUv-eTA==\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ycO9fEIk1qE7oVIpbG7vwzFN|fc_0bcbe30df39175930169d6547beaa0819699ee8149c3fce286","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/Users/chongya/.openclaw/workspace/agents/merchant-onboarding/skills/fuiou/fuiou_login_step0.1/runner.py"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/Users/chongya/.openclaw/workspace/agents/merchant-onboarding/skills/fuiou/fuiou_login_step0.1/runner.py\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":2828,"output":85,"cacheRead":14336,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17249,"cost":{"input":0.004949,"output":0.00119,"cacheRead":0.0025088,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0086478}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775654008861}}
{"type":"message","id":"474112fa","parentId":"31cc48b0","timestamp":"2026-04-08T13:13:32.592Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_ycO9fEIk1qE7oVIpbG7vwzFN|fc_0bcbe30df39175930169d6547beaa0819699ee8149c3fce286","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\nfuiou_login_runner.py — 富友通登录流程的确定性执行器\n\n设计原则：\n  - 正常路径的每一步都是代码执行，LLM 无法替代\n  - GATE_OUT 是代码级断言，通过/不通过由程序判定\n  - 只在需要视觉判断的地方 yield 给 LLM（返回 NEED_LLM）\n  - agent 的职责：调用本脚本 → 读返回值 → 按 next 字段继续或处理异常\n\n用法：\n  python3 runner.py step1_launch\n  python3 runner.py step4_slider --slider_y 1440\n  python3 runner.py run_all          # 自动跑全流程，遇到 NEED_LLM 时停下\n\"\"\"\n\nfrom __future__ import annotations\nimport subprocess\nimport sys\nimport json\nimport re\nimport time\nimport os\n\nDEVICE = \"GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK\"\nADB = \"/opt/homebrew/bin/adb\"\nSCREENSHOT_LOCAL = \"/tmp/screen.png\"\nUI_XML_LOCAL = \"/tmp/ui.xml\"\n\n\n# ─── 基础工具 ───────────────────────────────────────────\n\ndef adb(cmd: str) -> subprocess.CompletedProcess:\n    \"\"\"执行 adb 命令，返回 CompletedProcess\"\"\"\n    full_cmd = f\"{ADB} -s {DEVICE} {cmd}\"\n    return subprocess.run(full_cmd, shell=True, capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=30)\n\n\ndef screenshot() -> str:\n    \"\"\"截图并拉到本地，返回本地路径\"\"\"\n    adb(\"shell screencap /sdcard/tmp/screen.png\")\n    adb(\"pull /sdcard/tmp/screen.png \" + SCREENSHOT_LOCAL)\n    return SCREENSHOT_LOCAL\n\n\ndef dump_ui() -> str:\n    \"\"\"导出 UI 树并拉到本地，返回 xml 内容\"\"\"\n    adb(\"shell uiautomator dump /sdcard/ui.xml\")\n    adb(\"pull /sdcard/ui.xml \" + UI_XML_LOCAL)\n    with open(UI_XML_LOCAL, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        return f.read()\n\n\ndef get_current_focus() -> str:\n    \"\"\"获取当前 Activity\"\"\"\n    result = adb(\"shell dumpsys activity | grep mCurrentFocus\")\n    return result.stdout.strip()\n\n\ndef find_bounds(xml: str, pattern: str) -> tuple | None:\n    \"\"\"\n    在 ui.xml 中搜索包含 pattern 的节点，提取 bounds 并计算中心点。\n    返回 (cx, cy, x1, y1, x2, y2) 或 None\n    \"\"\"\n    # 找包含 pattern 的节点段\n    idx = xml.find(pattern)\n    if idx == -1:\n        return None\n    # 向后搜索最近的 bounds\n    chunk = xml[max(0, idx - 300):idx + 500]\n    match = re.search(r'bounds=\"\\[(\\d+),(\\d+)\\]\\[(\\d+),(\\d+)\\]\"', chunk)\n    if not match:\n        return None\n    x1, y1, x2, y2 = int(match.group(1)), int(match.group(2)), int(match.group(3)), int(match.group(4))\n    # 排除不可见元素\n    if x1 == 0 and y1 == 0 and x2 == 0 and y2 == 0:\n        return None\n    cx, cy = (x1 + x2) // 2, (y1 + y2) // 2\n    return (cx, cy, x1, y1, x2, y2)\n\n\ndef tap(x: int, y: int, sleep_after: float = 0.5):\n    \"\"\"点击坐标\"\"\"\n    adb(f\"shell input tap {x} {y}\")\n    time.sleep(sleep_after)\n\n\ndef result_ok(next_step: str, **extra) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"构造成功返回\"\"\"\n    return {\"status\": \"ok\", \"next\": next_step, **extra}\n\n\ndef result_need_llm(reason: str, **extra) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"构造需要 LLM 介入的返回\"\"\"\n    return {\"status\": \"NEED_LLM\", \"reason\": reason, \"screenshot\": SCREENSHOT_LOCAL, **extra}\n\n\ndef result_fail(reason: str, **extra) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"构造失败返回\"\"\"\n    return {\"status\": \"FAIL\", \"reason\": reason, **extra}\n\n\n# ─── Step 实现 ──────────────────────────────────────────\n\ndef step0_preflight() -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Step 0: 检查 ADB 连接\"\"\"\n    result = adb(\"devices\")\n    if DEVICE not in result.stdout or \"device\" not in result.stdout.split(DEVICE)[-1]:\n        return result_fail(\"adb_not_connected\", adb_output=result.stdout.strip())\n    return result_ok(\"step1_launch\", message=\"ADB connected\")\n\n\ndef step1_launch() -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Step 1: 启动 App（确定性命令，不可替代）\"\"\"\n    # 确定性操作：用包名启动，不是在屏幕上找图标\n    adb(\"shell monkey -p com.fuiou.pay.fybussess -c android.intent.category.LAUNCHER 1\")\n    time.sleep(3)\n\n    # GATE_OUT: 代码级检查\n    focus = get_current_focus()\n\n    if \"com.fuiou.pay.fybussess\" not in focus:\n        # App 未启动或启动了错误的 App\n        screenshot()\n        return result_need_llm(\n            \"wrong_app_or_not_started\",\n            current_focus=focus,\n            instruction=\"App 未正确启动。请看截图判断当前界面，可能需要处理弹窗或其他情况。\"\n        )\n\n    if \"LoginActivity\" in focus:\n        return result_ok(\"step2_checkbox\", current_focus=focus)\n    elif \"MainActivity\" in focus:\n        return result_ok(\"step6_post_login_popup\", current_focus=focus)\n    else:\n        # 在富友通内但不是 Login 也不是 Main\n        screenshot()\n        return result_need_llm(\n            \"unexpected_activity\",\n            current_focus=focus,\n            instruction=\"在富友通内但 Activity 不是 Login/Main。请看截图判断当前界面。\"\n        )\n\n\ndef step2_checkbox() -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Step 2: 勾选协议复选框\"\"\"\n    xml = dump_ui()\n\n    # 精确查找 CheckBox 节点（class=android.widget.CheckBox 且 checkable=true）\n    cb_match = re.search(\n        r'class=\"android\\.widget\\.CheckBox\"[^>]*'\n        r'checkable=\"true\"[^>]*'\n        r'checked=\"(\\w+)\"[^>]*'\n        r'bounds=\"\\[(\\d+),(\\d+)\\]\\[(\\d+),(\\d+)\\]\"',\n        xml\n    )\n\n    # 备选：按 resource-id 含 agreementCb / Cb / Check 查找\n    if not cb_match:\n        cb_match = re.search(\n            r'resource-id=\"[^\"]*[Cc][Bb][^\"]*\"[^>]*'\n            r'checked=\"(\\w+)\"[^>]*'\n            r'bounds=\"\\[(\\d+),(\\d+)\\]\\[(\\d+),(\\d+)\\]\"',\n            xml\n        )\n\n    if not cb_match:\n        screenshot()\n        return result_need_llm(\n            \"checkbox_not_found\",\n            instruction=\"在 ui.xml 中未找到协议复选框（CheckBox class）。请看截图确认页面状态，手动找到并勾选协议。\"\n        )\n\n    checked = cb_match.group(1)\n    x1, y1, x2, y2 = int(cb_match.group(2)), int(cb_match.group(3)), int(cb_match.group(4)), int(cb_match.group(5))\n    cx, cy = (x1 + x2) // 2, (y1 + y2) // 2\n\n    if checked == \"false\":\n        tap(cx, cy)\n\n    # GATE_OUT: 验证勾选状态\n    xml2 = dump_ui()\n    cb_match2 = re.search(\n        r'class=\"android\\.widget\\.CheckBox\"[^>]*'\n        r'checkable=\"true\"[^>]*'\n        r'checked=\"(\\w+)\"',\n        xml2\n    )\n\n    if cb_match2 and cb_match2.group(1) == \"true\":\n        return result_ok(\"step3_click_login\", checkbox_position={\"cx\": cx, \"cy\": cy})\n\n    # 仍未勾选 — 可能需要点击父容器（xysLl）而非 checkbox 本身\n    # 尝试点击父容器区域（更大的点击范围）\n    parent_match = re.search(\n        r'resource-id=\"[^\"]*xysLl[^\"]*\"[^>]*'\n        r'bounds=\"\\[(\\d+),(\\d+)\\]\\[(\\d+),(\\d+)\\]\"',\n        xml2\n    )\n    if parent_match:\n        px1, py1, px2, py2 = [int(g) for g in parent_match.groups()]\n        pcx, pcy = (px1 + px2) // 2, (py1 + py2) // 2\n        tap(pcx, pcy)\n        # 再验一次\n        xml3 = dump_ui()\n        cb_match3 = re.search(r'class=\"android\\.widget\\.CheckBox\"[^>]*checked=\"(\\w+)\"', xml3)\n        if cb_match3 and cb_match3.group(1) == \"true\":\n            return result_ok(\"step3_click_login\", checkbox_position={\"cx\": pcx, \"cy\": pcy})\n\n    screenshot()\n    return result_need_llm(\n        \"checkbox_still_unchecked\",\n        tap_position={\"cx\": cx, \"cy\": cy},\n        instruction=\"点击 checkbox 及父容器后仍未勾选。请看截图确认，可能需要调整坐标。\"\n    )\n\n\ndef step3_click_login() -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Step 3: 点击登录按钮\"\"\"\n    xml = dump_ui()\n\n    # 找登录按钮（实际 text 为\"登 录\"带空格）\n    login_bounds = find_bounds(xml, 'text=\"登 录\"')\n    if not login_bounds:\n        login_bounds = find_bounds(xml, 'text=\"登录\"')\n    if not login_bounds:\n        login_bounds = find_bounds(xml, 'userLoginTv')\n    if not login_bounds:\n        screenshot()\n        return result_need_llm(\n            \"login_button_not_found\",\n            instruction=\"在 ui.xml 中未找到登录按钮。请看截图确认。\"\n        )\n\n    cx, cy = login_bounds[0], login_bounds[1]\n    tap(cx, cy, sleep_after=2)\n\n    # GATE_OUT: 判断点击后的状态\n    focus = get_current_focus()\n\n    # 可能出现\"是否确认同意\"弹窗\n    xml2 = dump_ui()\n    if \"确认同意\" in xml2 or \"是否确认\" in xml2:\n        agree_bounds = find_bounds(xml2, 'text=\"同意\"')\n        if agree_bounds:\n            tap(agree_bounds[0], agree_bounds[1], sleep_after=1)\n            # 再次点击登录\n            tap(cx, cy, sleep_after=2)\n            focus = get_current_focus()\n\n    # 检查是否进入滑块页\n    screenshot()\n    xml3 = dump_ui()\n\n    if \"MainActivity\" in focus:\n        return result_ok(\"step6_post_login_popup\", current_focus=focus)\n\n    if \"滑块\" in xml3 or \"拖动\" in xml3 or \"验证\" in xml3:\n        return result_ok(\"step4_slider_need_y\",\n                        message=\"滑块验证页已出现，需要 LLM 提供滑块 Y 坐标\")\n\n    # 仍在 LoginActivity 且无滑块\n    return result_need_llm(\n        \"login_click_no_response\",\n        current_focus=focus,\n        instruction=\"点击登录后既没进入滑块页也没进入主界面。请看截图判断。可能协议未勾选或有其他弹窗。\"\n    )\n\n\ndef step4_slider_need_y() -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Step 4a: 截图，让 LLM 提供滑块 Y 坐标\"\"\"\n    screenshot()\n    return result_need_llm(\n        \"need_slider_y\",\n        instruction=\"请看截图，找到滑块条的 Y 坐标（通常在屏幕 60%-70% 高度处，约 1400-1700）。然后调用: python3 runner.py step4_slider --slider_y <Y坐标>\"\n    )\n\n\ndef step4_slider(slider_y: int) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Step 4b: 执行滑块验证（LLM 提供了 Y 坐标）\"\"\"\n    # 确定性操作：固定的 swipe 命令\n    adb(f\"shell input swipe 100 {slider_y} 980 {slider_y} 800\")\n    time.sleep(3)\n\n    # GATE_OUT: 检查滑块是否通过\n    focus = get_current_focus()\n\n    if \"MainActivity\" in focus:\n        return result_ok(\"step6_post_login_popup\", current_focus=focus)\n\n    # 可能滑块通过了但还在 loading\n    time.sleep(2)\n    focus = get_current_focus()\n    if \"MainActivity\" in focus:\n        return result_ok(\"step6_post_login_popup\", current_focus=focus)\n\n    # 检查是否仍在滑块页\n    xml = dump_ui()\n    if \"滑块\" in xml or \"拖动\" in xml or \"验证\" in xml:\n        screenshot()\n        # 第一次失败，自动重试一次（调整参数）\n        adb(f\"shell input swipe 80 {slider_y} 1000 {slider_y} 900\")\n        time.sleep(3)\n        focus = get_current_focus()\n        if \"MainActivity\" in focus:\n            return result_ok(\"step6_post_login_popup\", current_focus=focus)\n\n        # 第二次重试\n        adb(f\"shell input swipe 100 {slider_y + 20} 990 {slider_y + 20} 850\")\n        time.sleep(3)\n        focus = get_current_focus()\n        if \"MainActivity\" in focus:\n            return result_ok(\"step6_post_login_popup\", current_focus=focus)\n\n        # 3 次都失败\n        screenshot()\n        return result_fail(\n            \"slider_failed_3_attempts\",\n            slider_y=slider_y,\n            current_focus=focus,\n            screenshot=SCREENSHOT_LOCAL\n        )\n\n    # 不在滑块页也不在 MainActivity\n    screenshot()\n    return result_need_llm(\n        \"post_slider_unknown\",\n        current_focus=focus,\n        instruction=\"滑块操作后进入了未知页面。请看截图判断当前状态。\"\n    )\n\n\ndef step5_verify_main() -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Step 5: 验证已进入 MainActivity\"\"\"\n    focus = get_current_focus()\n    if \"MainActivity\" in focus:\n        return result_ok(\"step6_post_login_popup\", current_focus=focus)\n\n    screenshot()\n    return result_need_llm(\n        \"not_in_main_activity\",\n        current_focus=focus,\n        instruction=\"未在 MainActivity。请看截图判断。\"\n    )\n\n\ndef step6_post_login_popup() -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Step 6: 处理登录后弹窗（绑定手机提醒等）\"\"\"\n    time.sleep(1)\n    xml = dump_ui()\n\n    # 检查是否有\"绑定手机\"弹窗\n    dismiss_texts = [\"否\", \"取消\", \"暂不\", \"关闭\"]\n    popup_keywords = [\"绑定手机\", \"提醒\", \"温馨提示\"]\n\n    has_popup = any(kw in xml for kw in popup_keywords)\n\n    if has_popup:\n        for btn_text in dismiss_texts:\n            bounds = find_bounds(xml, f'text=\"{btn_text}\"')\n            if bounds:\n                tap(bounds[0], bounds[1], sleep_after=1)\n                break\n\n    # GATE_OUT: 验证主界面可见\n    time.sleep(0.5)\n    focus = get_current_focus()\n    xml2 = dump_ui()\n\n    # 检查是否还有弹窗（可能有多个）\n    has_popup2 = any(kw in xml2 for kw in popup_keywords)\n    if has_popup2:\n        for btn_text in dismiss_texts:\n            bounds = find_bounds(xml2, f'text=\"{btn_text}\"')\n            if bounds:\n                tap(bounds[0], bounds[1], sleep_after=1)\n                break\n\n    # 最终确认\n    focus = get_current_focus()\n    if \"MainActivity\" in focus:\n        screenshot()\n        return result_ok(\n            \"DONE\",\n            current_focus=focus,\n            message=\"登录完成，已在主界面\",\n            screenshot=SCREENSHOT_LOCAL\n        )\n\n    screenshot()\n    return result_need_llm(\n        \"main_activity_not_confirmed\",\n        current_focus=focus,\n        instruction=\"处理弹窗后仍未确认在主界面。请看截图判断。\"\n    )\n\n\ndef run_all() -> dict:\n    \"\"\"自动执行全流程，遇到 NEED_LLM 时停下\"\"\"\n    # Step 0: preflight\n    r = step0_preflight()\n    if r[\"status\"] != \"ok\":\n        return r\n\n    # Step 1: launch\n    r = step1_launch()\n    if r[\"status\"] != \"ok\":\n        return r\n\n    # 根据 next 自动路由\n    step = r[\"next\"]\n    while step != \"DONE\":\n        if step not in STEPS:\n            return result_fail(\"unknown_step\", step=step)\n\n        r = STEPS[step]()\n\n        if r[\"status\"] == \"NEED_LLM\":\n            return r  # 停下，等 LLM 介入\n        if r[\"status\"] == \"FAIL\":\n            return r  # 停下，失败\n        if r[\"status\"] != \"ok\":\n            return r\n\n        step = r.get(\"next\", \"DONE\")\n\n    return r\n\n\n# ─── Step 注册表 ─────────────────────────────────────────\n\nSTEPS = {\n    \"step0_preflight\": step0_preflight,\n    \"step1_launch\": step1_launch,\n    \"step2_checkbox\": step2_checkbox,\n    \"step3_click_login\": step3_click_login,\n    \"step4_slider_need_y\": step4_slider_need_y,\n    \"step4_slider\": step4_slider,\n    \"step5_verify_main\": step5_verify_main,\n    \"step6_post_login_popup\": step6_post_login_popup,\n    \"run_all\": run_all,\n}\n\n\n# ─── CLI 入口 ────────────────────────────────────────────\n\ndef main():\n    if len(sys.argv) < 2:\n        print(json.dumps({\n            \"usage\": \"python3 runner.py <step_name> [--slider_y <Y>]\",\n            \"available_steps\": list(STEPS.keys())\n        }, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))\n        sys.exit(0)\n\n    step_name = sys.argv[1]\n\n    if step_name not in STEPS:\n        print(json.dumps(result_fail(\"unknown_step\", step=step_name, available=list(STEPS.keys())),\n                         ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))\n        sys.exit(1)\n\n    # 解析可选参数\n    kwargs = {}\n    i = 2\n    while i < len(sys.argv):\n        if sys.argv[i].startswith(\"--\") and i + 1 < len(sys.argv):\n            key = sys.argv[i][2:]\n            val = sys.argv[i + 1]\n            # 尝试转数字\n            try:\n                val = int(val)\n            except ValueError:\n                try:\n                    val = float(val)\n                except ValueError:\n                    pass\n            kwargs[key] = val\n            i += 2\n        else:\n            i += 1\n\n    # 调用 step\n    func = STEPS[step_name]\n    try:\n        if kwargs:\n            r = func(**kwargs)\n        else:\n            r = func()\n    except TypeError as e:\n        r = result_fail(\"bad_args\", error=str(e),\n                        hint=f\"该步骤可能需要参数，如 --slider_y 1440\")\n\n    print(json.dumps(r, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775654012587}}
