{"type":"message","id":"23cf3737","parentId":"9a3e8726","timestamp":"2026-04-08T13:14:00.357Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_Zx0zcaxL41JORk9vGUrVqmlb|fc_0bcbe30df39175930169d6547f5418819693c694eef9922aeb","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"next\": \"DONE\",\n  \"current_focus\": \"mCurrentFocus=Window{eff96f3 u0 com.fuiou.pay.fybussess/com.fuiou.pay.fybussess.activity.MainActivity}\",\n  \"message\": \"登录完成，已在主界面\",\n  \"screenshot\": \"/tmp/screen.png\"\n}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":23694,"aggregated":"{\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"next\": \"DONE\",\n  \"current_focus\": \"mCurrentFocus=Window{eff96f3 u0 com.fuiou.pay.fybussess/com.fuiou.pay.fybussess.activity.MainActivity}\",\n  \"message\": \"登录完成，已在主界面\",\n  \"screenshot\": \"/tmp/screen.png\"\n}","cwd":"/Users/chongya/.openclaw/workspace/agents/merchant-onboarding"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775654040352}}
{"type":"message","id":"7144a4bb","parentId":"23cf3737","timestamp":"2026-04-08T13:14:06.834Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0bcbe30df39175930169d6549aaca08196b60d9d97dd12dfc4\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABp1lSexolfARCUcT-ASJ9JIFTJZrswMGVA6ubauovralUswfGB7cM9p1t8zWyaVhsCZzUO5GHP0rPaluyWirsoyL305tQlj3hbLT-QXZum0EL2yc-ugLcqcE5h_R8exExKk3D97XsKT-DZLjdpz7CYSajyEmIzsmfn_PsbU2GGpQsQTYBMDv84ZkyjZhpUg2iiiZAkAPYDrGjgBSVhIR_QUL-5bXwdld_OUq8Pg1toBlzKGiYz_7l3q9aWoDr7hh9vn-TKR0eYM8jPw9Byn8EkkZee0GG9U45kAURl1aTb1w-boJdSEaIXQp616SFu4C2KbrnWt-6ln-SLO7WVqlKpg5Y2ScjJVaPL9dVkYn7tFfIWiNvt60yCTe653Ax1KpXyH5W79_zBSZV9lpUR0yXvRZe6jLNZtKTP-Q7gKQoI9IGWvLr_HKOPK679ZQu9BGd-TqU7UIJdbIWkknNWR9NjdQh5WzZF5akxKvHTOxxhy5Ja01XpOmMlT9OgEd2SExGqHqUTsuqudB6ECzlIxviLXgln-0lAlAePrbPlvaK2O7RGjgHkHLYYPG_F87TgO5dYtlYlvfkYx2g0rWZHoebrmVx3k8cJSD_I2S0qn5o9o9yRCHXiaFnQNAA6tlScUg7lM7vjVS326SyBYF3piieNwX2NZyoaKU8M2u8dVeYVsk_ivP38vKX1r35I9FgcHRESs9HSKzCuWwQEp3n6YeGkSIEfRFf3V8ZZ4Q2izua7-RV169GV6hgCcqPKo-3lPGw7azZmKzd5d_jVLxSLbLMmMMgOPfBK5CmdmV-oQs3_a-faQKwPWEVVkYyTqcyMo3BIH473qtAX-3l4cag8S9TeNbVu61aoTfnS-NuBJTf2pqJi1LwDqCPFqyx6fuinodtzAxYqDE1TZ07sHNpNxzj-NdTcMg==\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_NxF0t1zmR3xVH1eNon0GZj1Q|fc_0bcbe30df39175930169d6549e88888196a9427f761d227988","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/Users/chongya/.openclaw/workspace/agents/merchant-onboarding/skills/fuiou/fuiou_open_merchant_onboarding_step0.2/SKILL.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/Users/chongya/.openclaw/workspace/agents/merchant-onboarding/skills/fuiou/fuiou_open_merchant_onboarding_step0.2/SKILL.md\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":268,"output":77,"cacheRead":21504,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21849,"cost":{"input":0.000469,"output":0.001078,"cacheRead":0.0037632,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0053102}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775654040357}}
{"type":"message","id":"767584fc","parentId":"7144a4bb","timestamp":"2026-04-08T13:14:06.846Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_NxF0t1zmR3xVH1eNon0GZj1Q|fc_0bcbe30df39175930169d6549e88888196a9427f761d227988","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: fuiou_open_merchant_onboarding\ndescription: 从富友通主界面（MainActivity）打开商户入网申请表单，进入第1步执照信息页。当需要新增商户入网、填写入网申请、开始入网流程时使用。前置条件：已登录并在主界面。\n---\n\n# fuiou_open_merchant_onboarding\n\n## 控制流约束\n\n本技能每步执行严格遵循 **GATE_IN → 操作 → GATE_OUT** 模式。GATE_OUT 不通过则不推进。输出报告**状态**，不报告判断。\n\n---\n\n## 执行流程\n\n### Step 1：确认当前在主界面\n\n**GATE_IN**：fuiou_login 已完成\n\n**操作**：\n\n```bash\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell screencap /sdcard/tmp/screen.png\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK pull /sdcard/tmp/screen.png /tmp/screen.png\n```\n\n读图检查主界面特征。\n\n**GATE_OUT**：\n\n- 截图中可见\"本月有效交易金额\"仪表盘 → 进入 Step 2\n- 不在主界面 → 进入 **FAIL_PATH_A**\n\n**FAIL_PATH_A（不在主界面）**：\n\n1. 获取当前 Activity：\n   ```bash\n   adb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell dumpsys activity | grep mCurrentFocus\n   ```\n2. 按情况处理：\n   - 在 LoginActivity → 输出状态，提示需先调用 `fuiou_login`，HALT\n   - 在其他 Activity → 截图描述页面内容，尝试按返回键回主界面：\n     ```bash\n     adb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell input keyevent KEYCODE_BACK\n     sleep 1\n     ```\n     重新截图判断。3 次返回仍不在主界面 → 输出状态，HALT\n\n---\n\n### Step 2：点击右下角 FAB（+号）按钮\n\n**GATE_IN**：截图确认在主界面\n\n**操作**：\n\nFAB 按钮固定在右下角，已知 bounds：`[952,1841][1067,1956]`\n\n```bash\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell input tap 1009 1898\nsleep 2\n```\n\n> **注意**：右上角还有一个图标（onlineIv，bounds [977,127][1054,214]）是智能客服入口，不要点错。目标是**右下角**的浮动按钮。\n\n**GATE_OUT**：\n\n```bash\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell uiautomator dump /sdcard/ui.xml\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK pull /sdcard/ui.xml /tmp/ui.xml\ngrep 'text=\"商户入网\"' /tmp/ui.xml\n```\n\n- 找到\"商户入网\" → 进入 Step 3\n- 未找到 → 进入 **FAIL_PATH_B**\n\n**FAIL_PATH_B（未进入入网表单）**：\n\n1. 截图查看当前页面：\n   ```bash\n   adb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell screencap /sdcard/tmp/screen.png\n   adb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK pull /sdcard/tmp/screen.png /tmp/screen.png\n   ```\n2. 读图判断：\n   - 看到智能客服界面 → 点了右上角图标，按返回键回主界面，修正坐标重新 tap (1009, 1898)\n   - 看到其他弹窗/浮层 → 描述内容，尝试关闭后重试\n   - 仍在主界面无变化 → FAB 可能被遮挡或坐标偏移，截图目视确认 FAB 实际位置，修正坐标重试\n3. 重试 1 次。仍失败 → 输出完整页面状态，HALT\n\n---\n\n### Step 3：验证已进入入网表单 Step 1\n\n**GATE_IN**：ui.xml 中找到\"商户入网\"\n\n**操作**：\n\n```bash\ngrep 'text=\"执照信息\"' /tmp/ui.xml\ngrep 'text=\"请选择地区\"' /tmp/ui.xml\n```\n\n**GATE_OUT**：\n\n- 两个 grep 均命中 → 入网表单 Step 1（执照信息）已打开，完成\n- \"执照信息\"找到但\"请选择地区\"未找到 → 可能在表单但不在 Step 1 视图，截图确认具体步骤\n- 均未找到 → 进入 **FAIL_PATH_C**\n\n**FAIL_PATH_C（表单结构不符预期）**：\n\n1. 截图，全面描述页面内容\n2. dump ui.xml，列出所有 `text` 非空的节点文字\n3. 判断：\n   - 在入网表单但步骤不是 1 → 输出当前步骤编号和名称\n   - 在完全不同的页面 → 输出页面描述，HALT\n\n---\n\n## 输出\n\n```json\n{\n  \"page_state\": {\n    \"page_title\": \"ui.xml 中实际的页面标题文字\",\n    \"current_step\": \"步骤条高亮的步骤编号\",\n    \"step_name\": \"步骤名称\",\n    \"visible_fields\": [\"页面上可见的字段列表\"],\n    \"screenshot_description\": \"截图描述\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 商户入网表单5步结构（供参考）\n\n| 步骤 | 名称 | 主要内容 |\n|------|------|---------|\n| 1 | 执照信息 | 营业执照 + 法人信息 |\n| 2 | 商户信息 | 商户名称/经营类型/详细地址/联系人 |\n| 3 | 结算信息 | 结算账户/银行卡 |\n| 4 | 门店信息 | 门店照片/地址 |\n| 5 | 业务信息 | 费率/终端/业务类型 |\n\n---\n\n## 验收场景\n\n| # | 初始状态 | 预期结果 |\n|---|---------|---------|\n| 1 | 主界面，仪表盘正常显示 | 点 FAB → 进入入网表单 Step 1，page_state 包含 step_name=\"执照信息\" |\n| 2 | 不在主界面（如在 LoginActivity） | FAIL_PATH_A 输出 current_focus，提示需先 fuiou_login |\n| 3 | 误点右上角客服图标 | FAIL_PATH_B 识别客服界面 → 返回 → 修正坐标重试 → 成功进入表单 |\n| 4 | FAB 不存在或被遮挡 | 截图描述实际页面，输出状态，HALT |\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775654046841}}
