{"type":"message","id":"604c4e3b","parentId":"48131e12","timestamp":"2026-04-08T13:14:32.449Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0bcbe30df39175930169d654b63a8c819693e26c15e30f549d\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABp1lS4KQWiwJHh5ApnYY9oPYIG_xh14eYoe0sC4nHbu_2pZFGF-PMEY2HhcIKSHrUH9zfQrrRGI_5y9vjlnfuSIfQPnQTXeXGl7zeLqKaGCus9ZYtpveq3rFSCy765EPSyvcdIxIm1cPxVAbBetlPXFAib87U3wnvlO_MaJCAIYmHGc11RdR-jQVhFmHkJO8I8bmgV2Y-Yn5mvWGLzM5bmkLE73TuO_NTQqkCLo-yQPrrPFl9olEhmA4MxIc69RK87lmJCMHwD_f1yqfSFehKJxOrbzMd_6cuBoZpE2xfxnKDZkg4d4Gf6kIcQe9e6UJd7l_pCmZrRqAOv7Ltm9bb_8gOIxIBty3YxYa_BRNIOd44ssdz4hWZZSgAIxmcePdYo8uubjSOXuV6TosGFEgcdzpkXVHvtnFNsWCDIEB6SHwSROsaRjVA1xKTqtbUoANhmU_RU6s4Ieqggogk1rh3Q3wHa8c-T1se4wnzLWzIsWlZ_rzEYIxID6YYOiyYziFAT9JEpyDVafbNc0rVqxcyJl2Q2EeXOh2jruMYXTIo3lhO5DRCzH_CMpZzkQt4SR7BWsyuAI-DijoyqfrGnQ4XR8ytCsKgPeQaDVvSStFSrSsB4P-jVvaTNgJDAoaFD_yUa0kP8JQJ5UymENyDcg0IVHhrUBIBmIbKjYXZIcHcSbQwv8G393TRbEvEFInRDTklCX-f7_iX3omP8NTqPjbq9URSdtpkk2_4Zo4JhfpM7AtDigGZ7ncdWoOBWLOppiXHhDn_1HXtJhghtDEna_IFqoub2T840rdJTKrtYSBRlE1B10JdArtIbv8AhbMbbA0AxVxph--JXikh6vbpKfm5uIDFdSlQYfU_wJzzfrJ9w67xef_dup9kIEgHVXyRRSUvPXryCQc1eUhegHWbOUlCZugU_9A==\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_paTRLRAZFKSLv7DEsA3DtonC|fc_0bcbe30df39175930169d654b81bb88196aea08d5554ef827b","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/Users/chongya/.openclaw/workspace/agents/merchant-onboarding/skills/fuiou/fuiou_fill_step1_license/SKILL.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/Users/chongya/.openclaw/workspace/agents/merchant-onboarding/skills/fuiou/fuiou_fill_step1_license/SKILL.md\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":25404,"output":71,"cacheRead":23296,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":48771,"cost":{"input":0.044456999999999997,"output":0.000994,"cacheRead":0.0040768,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0495278}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775654067852}}
{"type":"message","id":"653ebbe0","parentId":"604c4e3b","timestamp":"2026-04-08T13:14:32.462Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_paTRLRAZFKSLv7DEsA3DtonC|fc_0bcbe30df39175930169d654b81bb88196aea08d5554ef827b","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: fuiou_fill_step1\ndescription: 填写富友通商户入网第1步全部内容。执行器：runner.py。流程：选地区+类别（滚轮）→ 营业执照上传（OCR）→ 法人信息（证件类型+身份证双面+手机号）。\n---\n\n# fuiou_fill_step1\n\n## 执行方式\n\n所有确定性操作由 `runner.py` 脚本完成。Agent 职责：\n\n1. 调用 `python3 runner.py <step>`\n2. 读返回值的 `status` 字段\n   - `ok` → 调用 `next` 字段指定的下一步\n   - `NEED_LLM` → 按 `instruction` 字段执行，完成后调用 `next` 指定的步骤\n   - `FAIL` → 按 `instruction` 诊断，不自行猜测\n\n```\npython3 runner.py run_all \\\n  --province 四川省 --city 乐山市 --district 峨眉山市 \\\n  --merchant_category 个体工商户 \\\n  --license_image_path /path/license.jpg \\\n  --id_front_path /path/id_front.jpg \\\n  --id_back_path /path/id_back.jpg \\\n  --phone 13678996331\n```\n\n---\n\n## LLM 介入点\n\n### 1. 省市区滚轮选择（step2 → step3）\n\nrunner 打开 picker 后返回 `NEED_LLM`。\n\n**滚轮通用规则：**\n- `swipe duration ≥ 400ms`，否则惯性甩动\n- 每次 swipe 后等 **0.8s** 再截图\n- 每行约 **70px**；方向：目标在下 → y 从大到小；目标在上 → y 从小到大\n\n**四川省快速定位（默认从安徽省开始）：**\n\n四川省约第 26 位，需大幅上滑：\n1. 连续 3 次大幅上滑（col1 x=168）：\n   ```bash\n   adb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell input swipe 168 1700 168 1000 450\n   sleep 0.8\n   ```\n2. 截图找参考点：\n   - 看到\"上海/山西/陕西\" → 四川在后 1-5 位，小步上滑\n   - 看到\"天津/西藏\" → 滑过了，向下微调\n3. 微调用 80-140px 单步对准\n\n**三列联动：** col1 确定后截图确认 col2 已更新再操作，col2 确定后截图确认 col3 已更新。\n\n完成后调用：`python3 runner.py step3_confirm_region --province X --city X --district X`\n\n---\n\n### 2. 商户类别滚轮选择（step4 → step5）\n\n列表极短（企业 / 个体工商户 / 小微），默认\"企业\"在中心：\n- 个体工商户 → 上滑 1 行（70px）\n- 小微 → 上滑 2 行（140px）\n\n完成后调用：`python3 runner.py step5_confirm_category --merchant_category X`\n\n---\n\n### 3. 营业执照上传（step6 → step7）\n\nrunner 截图后返回 `NEED_LLM`。视觉找到\"营业执照\"相机图标坐标，调用 `gallery_photo_upload`：\n```\nlocal_path: {license_image_path}\nupload_trigger_x: <相机图标 cx>\nupload_trigger_y: <相机图标 cy>\n```\n完成后调用：`python3 runner.py step7_verify_license`\n\n---\n\n### 4. 证件类型确认（step8 → step8b）\n\npicker 打开后，\"身份证\"通常已在中心行：\n- 已在中心 → 直接调用：`python3 runner.py step8b_confirm_cert_type`\n- 不在中心 → 向下滑到\"身份证\"，再调用上面命令\n\n---\n\n### 5. 身份证正面上传（step10 → step11）\n\n视觉找到左侧\"身份证人像面\"相机图标，调用 `gallery_photo_upload`：\n```\nlocal_path: {id_front_path}\nupload_trigger_x: <左侧相机图标 cx>\nupload_trigger_y: <左侧相机图标 cy>\n```\n完成后调用：`python3 runner.py step11_verify_id_front`\n\n---\n\n### 6. 身份证背面上传（step12 → step13）\n\n视觉找到右侧\"身份证国徽面\"相机图标，调用 `gallery_photo_upload`：\n```\nlocal_path: {id_back_path}\nupload_trigger_x: <右侧相机图标 cx>\nupload_trigger_y: <右侧相机图标 cy>\n```\n完成后调用：`python3 runner.py step13_verify_id_back`\n\n---\n\n## FAIL 处理原则\n\n- `FAIL` 状态不自行重试，读 `instruction` 字段诊断后报告给调用方\n- `NEED_LLM` 且重试后仍失败 → 输出当前 status + screenshot 路径，HALT\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775654072455}}
{"type":"message","id":"abf43fe0","parentId":"653ebbe0","timestamp":"2026-04-08T13:14:35.149Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0bcbe30df39175930169d654b9c9f08196a5a2d3d8b3a62574\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABp1lS61PlSSEmtIBUVurzKawlrsCSonm2d6rpG5iRpF5gFGFhO6nV2rWf-M5jSbbNxKkudv1k1xWE_XSh5ZT4XKvEmQab6jlUYFCkgRD1nuxW_Y-N9_ymSkfSl4kOoxA21158KemalJtiu0lw0GRjaVIZ2Bd42aAXscJtCPFjdcEACUI-rOEbKlcPcr34IyIFLd939vQv_QbqzrsAPK0ONXqXlq-5fhkPIQF6CphZ2HWdfdJDcawUDsDq9t8U1t4UPGSJ06rRwyngXKP3u1XrzhVBzruTgcCU8GRf6GWRHqulGQyhLaxsqBe2Mbzb9csC8C7uqDo9LXG1J36hq_PNsr0aqWU-4b3p6tqLbQ5IGzPTl6xY9vBh3qt2BAsQfK54zer7tH2hPMZXbKarlS7y9z2b9COoMNS-Mxp4J6c4oybPAqJzRbbi9gcN_kIox47nrkV9lqjTNCpKYjzoKQJDZCjBPjvpmMUcvF4SUmHM5yKFqxUp6BI1IkajCTcArosuy5hvpmuK5QrH3F3eBgD-Rv0ctlBMq2h08szAZ0OqWCwCpeCU11ueU2hMAyS1cXNM6mNmHcISZSLo3d3vUYItc8qys71296fcwjzDJrtCkJVLOfLVayrtzJiMtqjwc74rBhjFyk1UJ5YIEeMN-5wbf7C4S2UWjpdeJFLzbEAlJmoyZd7T_TBhdHx-EOj9KP56VV6HPsHDjNOFJLMRoiXcKktK9Bf8MAH2XJxgHKpZ5idha9vkq_2MFhg6PiGYtSHGabVEYYvfCYDw_PFOnierOmegdJ6El932RRd5jn-wK8PM-hU4rx53via2eL_BNf9k5yfpgZ-Nx8NhsCcsUWMorKdhYp2S0ToW1NnxeZFEQzc-765U=\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_0hJYpwjOeCYbLY06OJV2p8ZV|fc_0bcbe30df39175930169d654ba480881969a1c2e2dae7bdc3a","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/Users/chongya/.openclaw/workspace/agents/merchant-onboarding/skills/fuiou/fuiou_fill_step1_license/runner.py"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/Users/chongya/.openclaw/workspace/agents/merchant-onboarding/skills/fuiou/fuiou_fill_step1_license/runner.py\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":1246,"output":62,"cacheRead":48640,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":49948,"cost":{"input":0.0021805,"output":0.000868,"cacheRead":0.008512,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.011560500000000001}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775654072463}}
{"type":"message","id":"d3d44e23","parentId":"abf43fe0","timestamp":"2026-04-08T13:14:35.165Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_0hJYpwjOeCYbLY06OJV2p8ZV|fc_0bcbe30df39175930169d654ba480881969a1c2e2dae7bdc3a","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\nfuiou_fill_step1 runner — 商户入网 Step1 确定性执行器\n\nLLM 介入点（仅这些）：\n  1. step2_tap_region_field  → 返回 NEED_LLM，LLM 滚轮选省市区，完成后调用 step3_confirm_region\n  2. step4_tap_category_field → 返回 NEED_LLM，LLM 滚轮选类别，完成后调用 step5_confirm_category\n  3. step6_upload_license     → 返回 NEED_LLM，LLM 调用 gallery_photo_upload，完成后调用 step7_verify_license\n  4. step8_open_cert_type     → 返回 NEED_LLM，LLM 视觉确认\"身份证\"在中心，调用 step8b_confirm_cert_type\n  5. step10_upload_id_front   → 返回 NEED_LLM，LLM 调用 gallery_photo_upload，完成后调用 step11_verify_id_front\n  6. step12_upload_id_back    → 返回 NEED_LLM，LLM 调用 gallery_photo_upload，完成后调用 step13_verify_id_back\n\n用法：\n  python3 runner.py step1_check_page\n  python3 runner.py step3_confirm_region --province 四川省 --city 乐山市 --district 峨眉山市\n  python3 runner.py run_all --province 四川省 --city 乐山市 --district 峨眉山市 \\\\\n      --merchant_category 个体工商户 \\\\\n      --license_image_path /path/license.jpg \\\\\n      --id_front_path /path/id_front.jpg \\\\\n      --id_back_path /path/id_back.jpg \\\\\n      --phone 13678996331\n\"\"\"\n\nfrom __future__ import annotations\nimport subprocess\nimport sys\nimport json\nimport re\nimport time\n\nDEVICE = \"GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK\"\nADB = \"/opt/homebrew/bin/adb\"\nSCREENSHOT_LOCAL = \"/tmp/screen.png\"\nUI_XML_LOCAL = \"/tmp/ui.xml\"\n\n\n# ─── 基础工具 ────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\ndef adb(cmd: str) -> subprocess.CompletedProcess:\n    full_cmd = f\"{ADB} -s {DEVICE} {cmd}\"\n    return subprocess.run(full_cmd, shell=True, capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=30)\n\n\ndef screenshot() -> str:\n    adb(\"shell screencap /sdcard/tmp/screen.png\")\n    adb(\"pull /sdcard/tmp/screen.png \" + SCREENSHOT_LOCAL)\n    return SCREENSHOT_LOCAL\n\n\ndef dump_ui() -> str:\n    adb(\"shell uiautomator dump /sdcard/ui.xml\")\n    adb(\"pull /sdcard/ui.xml \" + UI_XML_LOCAL)\n    with open(UI_XML_LOCAL, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        return f.read()\n\n\ndef find_bounds(xml: str, pattern: str) -> tuple | None:\n    \"\"\"搜索包含 pattern 的节点，返回该节点自身的 (cx, cy, x1, y1, x2, y2) 或 None。\n\n    做法：找到 pattern 所在位置，向前回溯到最近的 '<node' 或 '<' 标签开头，\n    向后找到 '/>' 或 '>' 标签结尾，从这个完整节点中提取 bounds。\n    \"\"\"\n    idx = xml.find(pattern)\n    if idx == -1:\n        return None\n    # 向前找到包含 pattern 的节点开始标签 '<'\n    tag_start = xml.rfind('<', 0, idx)\n    if tag_start == -1:\n        return None\n    # 向后找到该节点的结束 '>' 或 '/>'\n    tag_end = xml.find('>', idx)\n    if tag_end == -1:\n        return None\n    node_str = xml[tag_start:tag_end + 1]\n    match = re.search(r'bounds=\"\\[(\\d+),(\\d+)\\]\\[(\\d+),(\\d+)\\]\"', node_str)\n    if not match:\n        return None\n    x1, y1, x2, y2 = int(match.group(1)), int(match.group(2)), int(match.group(3)), int(match.group(4))\n    if x1 == 0 and y1 == 0 and x2 == 0 and y2 == 0:\n        return None\n    return ((x1 + x2) // 2, (y1 + y2) // 2, x1, y1, x2, y2)\n\n\ndef find_text_value(xml: str, label: str) -> str | None:\n    \"\"\"找到 label 附近的 contentEt / spinnerTv / 输入框字段值。\n\n    策略：从 label 位置向后 1200 字符内，按优先级搜索：\n    1. contentEt（常规输入框）\n    2. spinnerTv（下拉选择回显）\n    3. 任意非空 text 属性（兜底）\n    \"\"\"\n    idx = xml.find(label)\n    if idx == -1:\n        return None\n    chunk = xml[idx:idx + 1200]\n\n    # 优先找 contentEt\n    match = re.search(r'resource-id=\"[^\"]*contentEt[^\"]*\"[^>]*text=\"([^\"]*)\"', chunk)\n    if match and match.group(1).strip():\n        return match.group(1).strip()\n\n    # 再找 spinnerTv（picker 选择后回显）\n    match = re.search(r'resource-id=\"[^\"]*spinnerTv[^\"]*\"[^>]*text=\"([^\"]*)\"', chunk)\n    if match and match.group(1).strip():\n        return match.group(1).strip()\n\n    # 兜底：找 label 之后第一个有实际文本内容的 text 属性（排除 label 自身和占位文本）\n    for m in re.finditer(r'text=\"([^\"]+)\"', chunk):\n        val = m.group(1).strip()\n        if val and val != label and not val.startswith('请选择'):\n            return val\n\n    return None\n\n\ndef tap(x: int, y: int, sleep_after: float = 0.5):\n    adb(f\"shell input tap {x} {y}\")\n    time.sleep(sleep_after)\n\n\ndef scroll_down(distance: int = 600):\n    adb(f\"shell input swipe 540 1400 540 {1400 - distance} 400\")\n    time.sleep(0.5)\n\n\ndef find_picker_confirm(xml: str) -> tuple | None:\n    \"\"\"查找 picker 确定按钮（两种 resource-id）\"\"\"\n    b = find_bounds(xml, 'id/finishTextView')\n    if not b:\n        b = find_bounds(xml, 'id/tv_finish')\n    return b\n\n\ndef result_ok(next_step: str, **extra) -> dict:\n    return {\"status\": \"ok\", \"next\": next_step, **extra}\n\n\ndef result_need_llm(reason: str, **extra) -> dict:\n    return {\"status\": \"NEED_LLM\", \"reason\": reason, \"screenshot\": SCREENSHOT_LOCAL, **extra}\n\n\ndef result_fail(reason: str, **extra) -> dict:\n    return {\"status\": \"FAIL\", \"reason\": reason, **extra}\n\n\n# ─── Steps ──────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\ndef step1_check_page() -> dict:\n    \"\"\"验证当前在 Step1 空白表单页\"\"\"\n    xml = dump_ui()\n    if \"商户入网\" not in xml:\n        screenshot()\n        return result_fail(\"not_on_merchant_onboarding\", instruction=\"当前不在商户入网页面，请导航至该页面后重试\")\n\n    if \"商家基本情况\" not in xml:\n        screenshot()\n        return result_fail(\"step1_not_visible\", instruction=\"未找到'商家基本情况'区块，可能已填写或不在 Step1\")\n\n    # 确认\"营业执照信息\"尚未展开（空白状态）\n    if \"营业执照信息\" in xml:\n        return result_ok(\"step2_tap_region_field\", message=\"页面已有部分填写，region/category 可能已选择\")\n\n    return result_ok(\"step2_tap_region_field\", message=\"Step1 空白表单确认\")\n\n\ndef step2_tap_region_field() -> dict:\n    \"\"\"点击商户所在地区字段，打开滚轮 picker\"\"\"\n    xml = dump_ui()\n    b = find_bounds(xml, '请选择地区')\n    if not b:\n        # 尝试找已有值的字段\n        b = find_bounds(xml, '商户所在地区')\n    if not b:\n        screenshot()\n        return result_fail(\"region_field_not_found\", instruction=\"未找到'请选择地区'字段\")\n\n    tap(b[0], b[1], sleep_after=1)\n    screenshot()\n\n    return result_need_llm(\n        \"wheel_select_region\",\n        instruction=\"\"\"picker 已打开，三列联动（省/市/区）。\n\n【滚轮通用规则】\n- swipe duration 必须 ≥ 400ms，否则惯性甩动停在不可预测位置\n- 每次 swipe 后等 0.8s 再截图，等惯性完全停止\n- 每行约 70px；N 行距离 = N×70px\n- 最小有效距离 80px，低于此系统忽略\n- 方向：目标在下方 → swipe y 从大到小（手指上划）；目标在上方 → swipe y 从小到大（手指下划）\n\n【四川省快速定位（列表默认从安徽省开始）】\n四川省在省份列表约第 26 位，需大幅上滑：\n1. 连续执行 2 次大幅上滑（col1 center_x=168）：\n   adb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell input swipe 168 1700 168 1000 450\n   sleep 0.8  # 每次滑完等 0.8s\n2. 截图识别当前中心行，找参考点：\n   - 看到\"上海/山东/山西/陕西\"附近 → 四川在其后 1-5 位，小步上滑\n   - 看到\"天津/西藏\"→ 滑过了，向下微调（swipe y 从小到大）\n   - 看到\"云南/浙江\"→ 大幅滑过，多步下滑回调\n3. 微调用单步 80-140px 精确对准\n\n【三列联动规则】\n- col1（省）选定后，截图确认 col2（市）列已更新，再操作 col2\n- col2（市）选定后，截图确认 col3（区县）列已更新，再操作 col3\n- 若联动未触发（下一列文字未变）→ 等 1s 重新截图\n\ncol1 center_x=168，col2 center_x=540，col3 center_x=912\npicker 中心行 y：请截图后视觉判断实际中心行位置（设备不同会变化）\n\n选好后【不要点确定】，调用：\npython3 runner.py step3_confirm_region --province <省> --city <市> --district <区县>\"\"\",\n        picker_columns={\"col1_center_x\": 168, \"col2_center_x\": 540, \"col3_center_x\": 912}\n    )\n\n\ndef step3_confirm_region(province: str, city: str, district: str) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"LLM 完成滚轮选择后：找确定按钮 → 点击 → 验证字段值\"\"\"\n    xml = dump_ui()\n    b = find_picker_confirm(xml)\n    if not b:\n        screenshot()\n        return result_fail(\"confirm_button_not_found\", instruction=\"picker 确定按钮未找到，picker 可能已关闭\")\n\n    tap(b[0], b[1], sleep_after=1)\n\n    # 验证字段值\n    xml2 = dump_ui()\n    region_b = find_bounds(xml2, '商户所在地区')\n    actual = find_text_value(xml2, '商户所在地区') or \"\"\n\n    expected_parts = [province, city, district]\n    # 地区值可能带空格分隔，如 \"四川省 乐山市 峨眉山市\"，也可能无空格\n    # 去掉空格后做包含匹配\n    actual_normalized = actual.replace(\" \", \"\").replace(\"\\u3000\", \"\")\n    if all(p.replace(\" \", \"\") in actual_normalized for p in expected_parts):\n        return result_ok(\"step4_tap_category_field\", region_display=actual)\n\n    # 字段值不对\n    screenshot()\n    return result_need_llm(\n        \"region_value_mismatch\",\n        actual=actual,\n        expected=f\"{province} {city} {district}\",\n        instruction=\"地区字段值不符，请重新点击地区字段，重新滚轮选择，然后再调用 step3_confirm_region\"\n    )\n\n\ndef step4_tap_category_field() -> dict:\n    \"\"\"点击商户类别字段，打开滚轮 picker\"\"\"\n    xml = dump_ui()\n    b = find_bounds(xml, '请选择商户类别')\n    if not b:\n        b = find_bounds(xml, '商户类别')\n    if not b:\n        screenshot()\n        return result_fail(\"category_field_not_found\")\n\n    tap(b[0], b[1], sleep_after=1)\n    screenshot()\n\n    return result_need_llm(\n        \"wheel_select_category\",\n        instruction=\"\"\"picker 已打开，单列，选项极短（企业 / 个体工商户 / 小微）。\n\n【滚轮规则】swipe duration ≥ 400ms，每次 swipe 后等 0.8s，每行约 70px\ncol1 center_x=540\n\n列表顺序通常为：企业（默认中心）→ 个体工商户 → 小微\n- 目标\"个体工商户\"→ 上滑 1 行：swipe 540 1680 540 1610 450\n- 目标\"小微\"→ 上滑 2 行：swipe 540 1680 540 1540 450\n- 目标\"企业\"已在中心 → 无需滑动\n\n选好后【不要点确定】，调用：\npython3 runner.py step5_confirm_category --merchant_category <类别>\"\"\",\n        picker_column={\"col1_center_x\": 540}\n    )\n\n\ndef step5_confirm_category(merchant_category: str) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"LLM 完成滚轮选择后：找确定按钮 → 点击 → 验证字段值 → 确认区块展开\"\"\"\n    xml = dump_ui()\n    b = find_picker_confirm(xml)\n    if not b:\n        screenshot()\n        return result_fail(\"confirm_button_not_found\", instruction=\"picker 确定按钮未找到\")\n\n    tap(b[0], b[1], sleep_after=1)\n\n    xml2 = dump_ui()\n    actual = find_text_value(xml2, '商户类别') or \"\"\n\n    if merchant_category not in actual:\n        screenshot()\n        return result_need_llm(\n            \"category_value_mismatch\",\n            actual=actual,\n            expected=merchant_category,\n            instruction=\"类别字段值不符，请重新点击字段，重新选择，再调用 step5_confirm_category\"\n        )\n\n    # 确认营业执照信息区块已展开\n    if \"营业执照信息\" not in xml2:\n        screenshot()\n        return result_need_llm(\n            \"license_section_not_expanded\",\n            instruction=\"类别已选但营业执照信息区块未展开，请截图确认页面状态\"\n        )\n\n    return result_ok(\"step6_upload_license\", category_display=actual, message=\"区块已展开\")\n\n\ndef step6_upload_license(license_image_path: str) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"滚动到营业执照上传区，截图，等待 LLM 调用 gallery_photo_upload\"\"\"\n    if not license_image_path:\n        return result_fail(\"missing_param\", param=\"license_image_path\")\n\n    # 滚动使营业执照上传区可见\n    scroll_down(400)\n    screenshot()\n\n    return result_need_llm(\n        \"upload_license\",\n        instruction=(\n            \"请看截图，找到'营业执照'相机图标中心坐标，调用 gallery_photo_upload：\"\n            f\"  local_path: {license_image_path}\"\n            \"  upload_trigger_x: <相机图标 x>\"\n            \"  upload_trigger_y: <相机图标 y>\"\n            \"上传完成后调用：python3 runner.py step7_verify_license\"\n        ),\n        license_image_path=license_image_path\n    )\n\n\ndef step7_verify_license() -> dict:\n    \"\"\"验证营业执照上传成功 + OCR 回填状态\"\"\"\n    time.sleep(2)\n    xml = dump_ui()\n    screenshot()\n\n    # 检查是否还是相机图标（上传失败）\n    # 通过 OCR 字段有无值来判断\n    ocr_fields = {\n        \"执照名称\": find_text_value(xml, '执照名称'),\n        \"证件代码\": find_text_value(xml, '证件代码'),\n        \"执照有效期\": find_text_value(xml, '执照有效期'),\n        \"经营范围\": find_text_value(xml, '经营范围'),\n        \"注册资金\": find_text_value(xml, '注册资金'),\n        \"注册地址\": find_text_value(xml, '注册地址'),\n    }\n\n    filled = {k: v for k, v in ocr_fields.items() if v}\n    unfilled = [k for k, v in ocr_fields.items() if not v]\n\n    # 如果一个字段都没回填，可能上传未成功\n    if not filled:\n        return result_need_llm(\n            \"license_upload_may_have_failed\",\n            ocr_fields=ocr_fields,\n            instruction=\"OCR 字段全部为空，请看截图确认营业执照是否已上传（显示缩略图而非相机图标）。若未上传，重新调用 step6_upload_license\"\n        )\n\n    return result_ok(\n        \"step8_open_cert_type\",\n        ocr_filled=filled,\n        ocr_unfilled=unfilled,\n        message=f\"OCR 回填 {len(filled)}/{len(ocr_fields)} 个字段\"\n    )\n\n\ndef step8_open_cert_type() -> dict:\n    \"\"\"滚动到法人信息区，找证件类型字段，打开 picker\"\"\"\n    # 继续往下滚\n    scroll_down(500)\n    time.sleep(0.3)\n\n    xml = dump_ui()\n    b = find_bounds(xml, '请选择证件类型')\n    if not b:\n        b = find_bounds(xml, '证件类型')\n    if not b:\n        scroll_down(300)\n        xml = dump_ui()\n        b = find_bounds(xml, '请选择证件类型')\n    if not b:\n        screenshot()\n        return result_fail(\"cert_type_field_not_found\", instruction=\"未找到证件类型字段，请检查页面是否已滚动到法人信息区\")\n\n    tap(b[0], b[1], sleep_after=1)\n    screenshot()\n\n    return result_need_llm(\n        \"verify_cert_type_picker\",\n        instruction=\"\"\"picker 已打开，单列证件类型。\n\n【滚轮规则】swipe duration ≥ 400ms，每次 swipe 后等 0.8s，每行约 70px\ncol1 center_x=540\n\n\"身份证\"通常是列表第一项，默认即在中心行：\n- 中心行已是\"身份证\" → 直接调用：python3 runner.py step8b_confirm_cert_type\n- 中心行不是\"身份证\" → 向下滑移到\"身份证\"（swipe y 从小到大），再调用：\n  python3 runner.py step8b_confirm_cert_type\"\"\"\n    )\n\n\ndef step8b_confirm_cert_type() -> dict:\n    \"\"\"点击证件类型 picker 确定按钮，验证字段值\"\"\"\n    xml = dump_ui()\n    b = find_picker_confirm(xml)\n    if not b:\n        screenshot()\n        return result_fail(\"confirm_button_not_found\", instruction=\"picker 确定按钮未找到\")\n\n    tap(b[0], b[1], sleep_after=1)\n\n    xml2 = dump_ui()\n    actual = find_text_value(xml2, '证件类型') or \"\"\n\n    if \"身份证\" in actual:\n        return result_ok(\"step9_push_id_cards\", cert_type_display=actual)\n\n    screenshot()\n    return result_need_llm(\n        \"cert_type_mismatch\",\n        actual=actual,\n        instruction=\"证件类型不是身份证，请重新打开 picker 调整，再调用 step8b_confirm_cert_type\"\n    )\n\n\ndef step9_push_id_cards(id_front_path: str, id_back_path: str) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"推送身份证两张图片到设备（顺序：先正面后背面）\"\"\"\n    if not id_front_path or not id_back_path:\n        return result_fail(\"missing_param\", params=[\"id_front_path\", \"id_back_path\"])\n\n    for label, src, dst in [\n        (\"正面\", id_front_path, \"/sdcard/Pictures/法人身份证正面.jpg\"),\n        (\"背面\", id_back_path,  \"/sdcard/Pictures/法人身份证背面.jpg\"),\n    ]:\n        r = adb(f'push \"{src}\" {dst}')\n        if r.returncode != 0:\n            return result_fail(f\"push_failed_{label}\", src=src, adb_output=r.stderr)\n        adb(f'shell am broadcast -a android.intent.action.MEDIA_SCANNER_SCAN_FILE -d \"file://{dst}\"')\n        time.sleep(1)\n\n    time.sleep(1)\n\n    # 验证文件存在\n    check = adb(\"shell ls -la /sdcard/Pictures/法人身份证正面.jpg /sdcard/Pictures/法人身份证背面.jpg\")\n    if \"No such file\" in check.stdout or check.returncode != 0:\n        return result_fail(\"files_not_found_after_push\", ls_output=check.stdout)\n\n    return result_ok(\"step10_upload_id_front\", message=\"两张身份证图片已推送\", files=check.stdout.strip())\n\n\ndef step10_upload_id_front(id_front_path: str) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"截图，等待 LLM 调用 gallery_photo_upload 上传身份证正面\"\"\"\n    if not id_front_path:\n        return result_fail(\"missing_param\", param=\"id_front_path\")\n\n    screenshot()\n\n    return result_need_llm(\n        \"upload_id_front\",\n        instruction=(\n            \"请看截图，找到左侧'身份证人像面'相机图标中心坐标，调用 gallery_photo_upload：\"\n            f\"  local_path: {id_front_path}\"\n            \"  upload_trigger_x: <左侧相机图标 x>\"\n            \"  upload_trigger_y: <左侧相机图标 y>\"\n            \"上传完成后调用：python3 runner.py step11_verify_id_front\"\n        ),\n        id_front_path=id_front_path\n    )\n\n\ndef step11_verify_id_front() -> dict:\n    \"\"\"验证身份证正面上传成功 + OCR（姓名、证件号码）\"\"\"\n    time.sleep(2)\n    xml = dump_ui()\n    screenshot()\n\n    name = find_text_value(xml, '姓名')\n    id_number = find_text_value(xml, '证件号码')\n\n    if not name and not id_number:\n        return result_need_llm(\n            \"id_front_ocr_empty\",\n            instruction=\"姓名和证件号码均为空，请看截图确认正面是否已显示缩略图。若未上传，重新调用 step10_upload_id_front\"\n        )\n\n    return result_ok(\n        \"step12_upload_id_back\",\n        ocr={\"name\": name, \"id_number\": id_number},\n        message=f\"正面上传成功，OCR: 姓名={'已填' if name else '空'} 证件号={'已填' if id_number else '空'}\"\n    )\n\n\ndef step12_upload_id_back(id_back_path: str) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"截图，等待 LLM 调用 gallery_photo_upload 上传身份证背面\"\"\"\n    if not id_back_path:\n        return result_fail(\"missing_param\", param=\"id_back_path\")\n\n    screenshot()\n\n    return result_need_llm(\n        \"upload_id_back\",\n        instruction=(\n            \"请看截图，找到右侧'身份证国徽面'相机图标中心坐标，调用 gallery_photo_upload：\"\n            f\"  local_path: {id_back_path}\"\n            \"  upload_trigger_x: <右侧相机图标 x>\"\n            \"  upload_trigger_y: <右侧相机图标 y>\"\n            \"上传完成后调用：python3 runner.py step13_verify_id_back\"\n        ),\n        id_back_path=id_back_path\n    )\n\n\ndef step13_verify_id_back() -> dict:\n    \"\"\"验证身份证背面上传成功 + OCR（证件有效期）\"\"\"\n    time.sleep(2)\n    xml = dump_ui()\n    screenshot()\n\n    period = find_text_value(xml, '证件有效期')\n\n    if not period:\n        return result_need_llm(\n            \"id_back_ocr_empty\",\n            instruction=\"证件有效期为空，请看截图确认背面是否已显示缩略图。若未上传，重新调用 step12_upload_id_back\"\n        )\n\n    return result_ok(\"step14_fill_phone\", ocr={\"period\": period})\n\n\ndef step14_fill_phone(phone: str) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"找法人联系方式输入框，填入手机号\"\"\"\n    if not phone:\n        return result_fail(\"missing_param\", param=\"phone\")\n\n    xml = dump_ui()\n    b = find_bounds(xml, '签约短信')\n    if not b:\n        b = find_bounds(xml, '法人联系方式')\n    if not b:\n        scroll_down(300)\n        xml = dump_ui()\n        b = find_bounds(xml, '签约短信')\n    if not b:\n        screenshot()\n        return result_fail(\"phone_field_not_found\", instruction=\"未找到法人联系方式输入框\")\n\n    tap(b[0], b[1], sleep_after=0.5)\n\n    # 清空后输入\n    adb(\"shell input keyevent KEYCODE_CTRL_A\")\n    time.sleep(0.2)\n    adb(f'shell input text \"{phone}\"')\n    time.sleep(0.5)\n    adb(\"shell input keyevent KEYCODE_BACK\")\n    time.sleep(0.5)\n\n    # 验证\n    xml2 = dump_ui()\n    actual = find_text_value(xml2, '签约短信') or find_text_value(xml2, '法人联系方式') or \"\"\n\n    if phone in actual:\n        return result_ok(\"step15_verify_all\", phone_display=actual)\n\n    # 重试：先长按全选再输入\n    tap(b[0], b[1], sleep_after=0.5)\n    adb(f\"shell input longclick {b[0]} {b[1]}\")\n    time.sleep(0.5)\n    adb(\"shell input keyevent KEYCODE_CTRL_A\")\n    time.sleep(0.2)\n    adb(f'shell input text \"{phone}\"')\n    time.sleep(0.5)\n    adb(\"shell input keyevent KEYCODE_BACK\")\n    time.sleep(0.5)\n\n    xml3 = dump_ui()\n    actual2 = find_text_value(xml3, '签约短信') or find_text_value(xml3, '法人联系方式') or \"\"\n\n    if phone in actual2:\n        return result_ok(\"step15_verify_all\", phone_display=actual2)\n\n    screenshot()\n    return result_need_llm(\n        \"phone_input_failed\",\n        actual=actual2,\n        expected=phone,\n        instruction=f\"手机号未正确填入（当前值：'{actual2}'）。请手动点击输入框，清空后输入 {phone}，完成后调用 step15_verify_all\"\n    )\n\n\ndef step15_verify_all() -> dict:\n    \"\"\"整体验证：截图 + 读取所有关键字段\"\"\"\n    # 滚回顶部\n    adb(\"shell input swipe 540 600 540 1800 400\")\n    time.sleep(0.5)\n\n    xml = dump_ui()\n    screenshot()\n\n    region = find_text_value(xml, '商户所在地区') or \"\"\n    category = find_text_value(xml, '商户类别') or \"\"\n    license_name = find_text_value(xml, '执照名称') or \"\"\n    cert_type = find_text_value(xml, '证件类型') or \"\"\n    name = find_text_value(xml, '姓名') or \"\"\n    id_number = find_text_value(xml, '证件号码') or \"\"\n    phone = find_text_value(xml, '签约短信') or find_text_value(xml, '法人联系方式') or \"\"\n\n    missing = []\n    if not region:     missing.append(\"商户所在地区\")\n    if not category:   missing.append(\"商户类别\")\n    if not cert_type:  missing.append(\"证件类型\")\n    if not name:       missing.append(\"姓名\")\n    if not id_number:  missing.append(\"证件号码\")\n    if not phone:      missing.append(\"法人联系方式\")\n\n    result = {\n        \"region\": region,\n        \"category\": category,\n        \"license_name\": license_name,\n        \"cert_type\": cert_type,\n        \"name\": name,\n        \"id_number\": id_number,\n        \"phone\": phone,\n        \"missing_fields\": missing\n    }\n\n    if missing:\n        return result_need_llm(\n            \"fields_missing\",\n            fields=result,\n            instruction=f\"以下字段为空：{missing}。请看截图确认，可能需要滚动页面查看完整内容\"\n        )\n\n    return result_ok(\"DONE\", fields=result, message=\"Step1 全部字段已填写完成\")\n\n\n# ─── run_all ─────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\ndef run_all(**kwargs) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"自动执行到第一个 NEED_LLM 为止\"\"\"\n    r = step1_check_page()\n    if r[\"status\"] != \"ok\":\n        return r\n\n    r = step2_tap_region_field()\n    # step2 必定返回 NEED_LLM（需要 LLM 做滚轮选择）\n    return r\n\n\n# ─── Step 注册表 ──────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nSTEPS = {\n    \"step1_check_page\":       (step1_check_page,       []),\n    \"step2_tap_region_field\": (step2_tap_region_field, []),\n    \"step3_confirm_region\":   (step3_confirm_region,   [\"province\", \"city\", \"district\"]),\n    \"step4_tap_category_field\": (step4_tap_category_field, []),\n    \"step5_confirm_category\": (step5_confirm_category, [\"merchant_category\"]),\n    \"step6_upload_license\":   (step6_upload_license,   [\"license_image_path\"]),\n    \"step7_verify_license\":   (step7_verify_license,   []),\n    \"step8_open_cert_type\":   (step8_open_cert_type,   []),\n    \"step8b_confirm_cert_type\": (step8b_confirm_cert_type, []),\n    \"step9_push_id_cards\":    (step9_push_id_cards,    [\"id_front_path\", \"id_back_path\"]),\n    \"step10_upload_id_front\": (step10_upload_id_front, [\"id_front_path\"]),\n    \"step11_verify_id_front\": (step11_verify_id_front, []),\n    \"step12_upload_id_back\":  (step12_upload_id_back,  [\"id_back_path\"]),\n    \"step13_verify_id_back\":  (step13_verify_id_back,  []),\n    \"step14_fill_phone\":      (step14_fill_phone,      [\"phone\"]),\n    \"step15_verify_all\":      (step15_verify_all,      []),\n    \"run_all\":                (run_all,                []),\n}\n\n\n# ─── CLI 入口 ─────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\ndef main():\n    if len(sys.argv) < 2:\n        print(json.dumps({\n            \"usage\": \"python3 runner.py <step_name> [--key value ...]\",\n            \"steps\": {k: v[1] for k, v in STEPS.items()}\n        }, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))\n        sys.exit(0)\n\n    step_name = sys.argv[1]\n    if step_name not in STEPS:\n        print(json.dumps(result_fail(\"unknown_step\", step=step_name, available=list(STEPS.keys())),\n                         ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))\n        sys.exit(1)\n\n    # 解析 --key value 参数\n    kwargs = {}\n    i = 2\n    while i < len(sys.argv):\n        if sys.argv[i].startswith(\"--\") and i + 1 < len(sys.argv):\n            key = sys.argv[i][2:]\n            val = sys.argv[i + 1]\n            try:\n                val = int(val)\n            except ValueError:\n                pass\n            kwargs[key] = val\n            i += 2\n        else:\n            i += 1\n\n    func, _ = STEPS[step_name]\n    try:\n        r = func(**kwargs) if kwargs else func()\n    except TypeError as e:\n        r = result_fail(\"bad_args\", error=str(e),\n                        required=STEPS[step_name][1])\n\n    print(json.dumps(r, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775654075157}}
{"type":"message","id":"9c8dc1e6","parentId":"d3d44e23","timestamp":"2026-04-08T13:14:39.175Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0bcbe30df39175930169d654bd6320819694b2e1ef5de71ff2\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABp1lS-XPLx1SeKLTuK1j_DERpZOKreo4meIh1pwXg8WswlK7QZ8IlVQ6AY93wDLCfXevKb5VDrj1IfXcc9qXKARumz_zUPfDHxG5uy0m-_QhnK4UN8GPwxQtL7YRCsAXnwsiZl6dUo0FgAmj2CB3DHihjTL9VbXDRfNZBmYFqq2GuDz9vNuWY2kdz0gIFx2LJwkc-PvYOjDrIqnqx0FF1ZnLxBPDPhTc-F9nxjgxr44-rVFcpI3UfKUqCVS86bMmD32SFlCurESQ_NFEpl1NhIdJH4RwogzEZRAhESUt03miAXdQJngey-wuDA43Yq9SnReEXKByhsWoS6oOv7uIRfLDskgWdDXoF-UhtYqvldIQSQbpBzkzzbip54zOlv0Bx-lj6zuFRWtfXDa4QjIehqOicASfBHyWdj_CgseQd9imVhx3glvIP4MbCjk53fQhtFX5UQLi0izPfkNy4FPjJ_7PBtCur25TQRpvVHDWzskYP-f56wc_3NyzYuj_41cBJ-_UcVfbEo1Mw7YnJoX03m5JwUfdr03UmfsShfyzbTHZFrq_i1xulp4E92VovF43l9qDw6avIyN46rjtwp3Q4cUneyUphAG6Veou1n0d6ufyQFltmnkjP4MUdC6-9uNOSAjaCcWC8VR4Oc2mPNZIQGxRTdPJjmG68kNdZUzvDCO1JYKm1oE84jIjsCH5oXDROUS0i6H35DrDO33yBbi0cPFCIWIQw9LhKiBtMB60dMkZ4dsoE0ufhQXKDqifL2sNSPRZqtCB78IRLFokhpalXdH8dCBrGcXxZwNOoaHChnmGaFCokAuTH9RkLluARo4r7-Qp3Znu_QUm0MZYf3_JI4bFdr_i0MG_LFTv3aSJjtFFjI3FK5CquhxYQGY00HFX6DDC40jEpj7nu3A3ksib7HHjT1BZqQ7y-TeaLroVhgtXDi1qmJXO6TdoZ8fm0xKh7GFkmYmPRyIry5vVKLn1BYz1hmEpysBa-lBdi-m6ZTe-mfQs-jF7fmTw4PxR_fWLgwgKYd3Ze00zLiUJc89S-lKVWD74c2089DcZbnRq4ln9vELoIF3c9ilQVcKncDZ6PdFJBQbyT7_xLeZ_qQrEvq_zATy2rC8AriixC5qTcr6rtvFKY=\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_Tj9GbuFrTZftCJAgD0Q36niN|fc_0bcbe30df39175930169d654bea2708196b40cb83e236deee3","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/Users/chongya/.openclaw/workspace/agents/merchant-onboarding/skills/fuiou/gallery_photo_upload/SKILL.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/Users/chongya/.openclaw/workspace/agents/merchant-onboarding/skills/fuiou/gallery_photo_upload/SKILL.md\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":7182,"output":88,"cacheRead":49792,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":57062,"cost":{"input":0.0125685,"output":0.001232,"cacheRead":0.0087136,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.022514100000000002}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775654075166}}
{"type":"message","id":"f7daf0fb","parentId":"9c8dc1e6","timestamp":"2026-04-08T13:14:39.188Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_Tj9GbuFrTZftCJAgD0Q36niN|fc_0bcbe30df39175930169d654bea2708196b40cb83e236deee3","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: gallery_photo_upload\ndescription: 将 Mac 本地图片推送到 Android 设备并通过相册上传到富友通表单字段。当需要上传营业执照、身份证、银行卡、门店照片等任何图片到富友通入网表单时使用。内部自动处理 adb push、media scan、相册选择、完成确认全流程。\n---\n\n# gallery_photo_upload\n\n## 控制流约束\n\n本技能每步执行严格遵循 **GATE_IN → 操作 → GATE_OUT** 模式。GATE_OUT 不通过则不推进。输出报告**状态**（上传区实际显示什么），不报告判断。\n\n---\n\n## 设计原则\n\n- **上传图片**统一推送到 `/sdcard/Pictures/fuiou_upload/`（专用隔离文件夹，每次上传前清空）\n- **截图**统一存到 `/sdcard/tmp/screen.png`，不在 Pictures 目录，不触发相册索引\n- 每次只推一张图、上传一张图，不批量推再按位置猜——相册里只有一张，永远选位置1，不会出错\n\n---\n\n## 输入参数\n\n| 参数 | 类型 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| local_path | string | Mac 侧图片绝对路径 |\n| upload_trigger_x | int | 上传区域点击坐标 X |\n| upload_trigger_y | int | 上传区域点击坐标 Y |\n\n---\n\n## 执行流程\n\n### Step 1：清空隔离文件夹，推送图片\n\n**GATE_IN**：`local_path` 文件存在（调用方已确认）\n\n**操作**：\n\n```bash\n# 清空隔离文件夹\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell rm -rf /sdcard/Pictures/fuiou_upload/\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell mkdir -p /sdcard/Pictures/fuiou_upload/\n\n# 推送图片\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK push \"{local_path}\" /sdcard/Pictures/fuiou_upload/upload.jpg\n\n# 触发 media scan\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell am broadcast \\\n  -a android.intent.action.MEDIA_SCANNER_SCAN_FILE \\\n  -d \"file:///sdcard/Pictures/fuiou_upload/upload.jpg\"\nsleep 2\n```\n\n**GATE_OUT**：\n\n```bash\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell ls -la /sdcard/Pictures/fuiou_upload/upload.jpg\n```\n\n- 文件存在且大小 > 0 → 进入 Step 2\n- 文件不存在或大小 = 0 → 进入 **FAIL_PATH_A**\n\n**FAIL_PATH_A（推送失败）**：\n\n1. **诊断**：检查 adb push 的输出是否有错误信息\n2. **可能原因 + 对应处理**：\n   - `local_path` 路径错误 → 输出状态：\n     ```json\n     {\n       \"status\": \"push_failed\",\n       \"reason\": \"local_file_not_found\",\n       \"local_path\": \"{local_path}\"\n     }\n     ```\n     HALT，需要调用方修正路径\n   - 设备存储满 → 输出 `adb shell df /sdcard` 结果，HALT\n   - ADB 连接断开 → 输出 `adb devices` 结果，HALT\n\n---\n\n### Step 2：点击上传区域，打开菜单\n\n**GATE_IN**：图片已推送到设备\n\n**操作**：\n\n```bash\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell input tap {upload_trigger_x} {upload_trigger_y}\nsleep 1\n```\n\n**GATE_OUT**：\n\n```bash\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell uiautomator dump /sdcard/ui.xml\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK pull /sdcard/ui.xml /tmp/ui.xml\ngrep 'text=\"从相册选择\"' /tmp/ui.xml\n```\n\n- 找到\"从相册选择\" → 记录 bounds，进入 Step 3\n- 未找到 → 进入 **FAIL_PATH_B**\n\n**FAIL_PATH_B（上传菜单未弹出）**：\n\n1. **诊断**：截图查看当前页面\n   ```bash\n   adb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell screencap /sdcard/tmp/screen.png\n   adb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK pull /sdcard/tmp/screen.png /tmp/screen.png\n   ```\n2. 读图判断：\n   - 看到菜单但文字不同（如\"选择照片\"）→ 用 ui.xml 查找实际按钮文字，tap 对应按钮\n   - 看到的是图片预览（该位置已有上传过的图片）→ 截图中描述已上传图片内容，输出状态让调用方判断是否需要重新上传\n   - 坐标完全点偏（未触发任何反应）→ 截图目视确认上传区真实位置，修正坐标重试 1 次\n3. 修正后重试 1 次。仍失败 → 输出完整页面状态，HALT\n\n---\n\n### Step 3：点击\"从相册选择\"，进入相册\n\n**GATE_IN**：上传菜单可见，已获取\"从相册选择\"bounds\n\n**操作**：\n\n```bash\n# 从 bounds 计算中心点\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell input tap {galleryTv_cx} {galleryTv_cy}\nsleep 3\n```\n\n**GATE_OUT**：截图确认相册已打开\n\n```bash\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell screencap /sdcard/tmp/screen.png\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK pull /sdcard/tmp/screen.png /tmp/screen.png\n```\n\n读图判断：\n- 看到相册界面（有图片缩略图网格）→ 进入 Step 4\n- 相册打开但为空（无图片）→ 进入 **FAIL_PATH_C**\n- 相册未打开（权限弹窗等）→ 进入 **FAIL_PATH_D**\n\n**FAIL_PATH_C（相册为空）**：\n\n1. media scan 未完成 → 重新执行 broadcast：\n   ```bash\n   adb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell am broadcast \\\n     -a android.intent.action.MEDIA_SCANNER_SCAN_FILE \\\n     -d \"file:///sdcard/Pictures/fuiou_upload/upload.jpg\"\n   sleep 3\n   ```\n2. 按返回键退出相册，重新执行 Step 2\n3. 第二次仍为空 → 尝试全量扫描：\n   ```bash\n   adb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell am broadcast \\\n     -a android.intent.action.MEDIA_MOUNTED \\\n     -d \"file:///sdcard\"\n   sleep 5\n   ```\n4. 重试 Step 2。第三次仍空 → 输出状态，HALT\n\n**FAIL_PATH_D（相册未打开 / 权限弹窗）**：\n\n1. 截图，检查 ui.xml 是否有权限请求弹窗\n2. 若有\"允许\"按钮 → tap \"允许\"，等 2s，截图确认相册是否打开\n3. 若无权限弹窗但相册未打开 → 输出页面状态，HALT\n\n---\n\n### Step 4：选中图片\n\n**GATE_IN**：相册已打开，至少有 1 张图片可见\n\n**操作**：\n\n读图确认相册中只有一张图（隔离文件夹保证），点击位置1：\n\n```bash\n# 位置1 通常在左上角第一个缩略图\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell input tap {photo1_cx} {photo1_cy}\nsleep 2\n```\n\n**GATE_OUT**：截图确认图片已被选中（出现勾选标记或预览）\n\n- 图片被选中 → 进入 Step 5\n- 相册中有多张图（隔离文件夹未清干净）→ 进入 **FAIL_PATH_E**\n\n**FAIL_PATH_E（相册中有多张图）**：\n\n1. 退出相册（按返回键）\n2. 重新执行 Step 1（清空文件夹 + 推送），确保 rm -rf 成功\n3. 重新从 Step 2 开始\n\n---\n\n### Step 5：点击\"完成\"确认选择\n\n**GATE_IN**：图片已选中\n\n**操作**：\n\n```bash\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell uiautomator dump /sdcard/ui.xml\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK pull /sdcard/ui.xml /tmp/ui.xml\n# grep picture_right 或 text=\"完成\" 取 bounds 中心点\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell input tap {finish_cx} {finish_cy}\nsleep 3\n```\n\n**GATE_OUT**：\n\n```bash\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK shell screencap /sdcard/tmp/screen.png\nadb -s GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK pull /sdcard/tmp/screen.png /tmp/screen.png\n```\n\n读图判断：\n- 已返回表单页面，上传区显示图片缩略图（非相机图标）→ 完成，进入 Step 6\n- 仍在相册/图片预览界面 → 进入 **FAIL_PATH_F**\n\n**FAIL_PATH_F（点完成后未返回表单）**：\n\n1. 截图，检查当前界面：\n   - 在图片裁剪界面 → 找\"确定\"或\"完成\"按钮，点击\n   - 在图片预览界面 → 找\"使用\"或\"确定\"按钮，点击\n   - 仍在相册网格 → \"完成\"按钮可能未点中，重新 dump 获取精确坐标，重试\n2. 重试 1 次。仍未返回 → 输出页面状态，HALT\n\n---\n\n### Step 6：验证上传结果\n\n**GATE_IN**：已返回表单页面\n\n**操作**：读取 Step 5 的截图，描述上传区当前显示内容\n\n**GATE_OUT**：上传区显示图片缩略图（非相机图标）→ 完成\n\n**输出**：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"page_state\": {\n    \"upload_area_content\": \"上传区显示的内容描述（缩略图/相机图标）\",\n    \"ocr_auto_filled_fields\": \"若有 OCR 自动回填，列出回填的字段名和值\",\n    \"screenshot_description\": \"当前表单页面整体状态\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 验收场景\n\n| # | 初始状态 | 输入 | 预期结果 |\n|---|---------|------|---------|\n| 1 | 表单上传区显示相机图标 | local_path=营业执照.jpg, trigger=(540,1157) | 上传区显示营业执照缩略图，OCR 回填执照名称等字段 |\n| 2 | local_path 指向不存在的文件 | local_path=/invalid/path.jpg | status=push_failed, reason=local_file_not_found, HALT |\n| 3 | 设备存储已满 | 任意有效 local_path | status=push_failed, 附 df 输出, HALT |\n| 4 | 相册打开后为空（media scan 延迟） | 有效参数 | 自动重试 broadcast + 重新进入相册，最终上传成功 |\n| 5 | 上传区已有之前的图片（非相机图标） | 新的 local_path | 点击上传区后可能进入图片预览而非菜单，FAIL_PATH_B 处理 |\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775654079182}}
